# Python environment selection

- Always activate the configured project conda environment before Python commands.
- Default in this workspace: `conda activate ASC`.
- If `ASC` is unavailable on this machine, discover environments with `conda env list` and use the project-specific environment selected by the user.
- If there is ambiguity, ask the user which environment to use before running Python commands.
- Do not assume `LRF` in this repository unless the user explicitly requests it for this project.
